From: albanread <albanread@googlemail.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 10:58:01 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] ProsePaint in Office, and clang with clangd

ProsePaint 0.1 (prosepaint-0.1-1, built by prosepkg from
prosepaint/app): the suite's painting application -- layers of RGBA
over a paper-sized canvas, pen, brush, airbrush, shapes, eraser to
transparency, .paint documents, PDF export -- joins ProseWriter and
ProseDraw in the Deskbar's Office folder.

clang 23.1.0-2 adds clangd: the language server that knows what clang
knows, for the editors that speak the Language Server Protocol to it
(one program, no new libraries; it links the LLVM and clang libraries
the compiler already ships).

Prose-Patch: 0094-prosepaint-in-office-and-clang-with-clangd.patch 16b95cd9db40884a4aef606196dfcb2a46bbe50232b13be76f9c6b32ff6cec1b
